From cd6c0f23b4cf08c0f8f07b920a9fc88c698d4f30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:52:55 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kcsan: limit watchpoint installation to NFS/RPC scope

Restrict KCSAN watchpoint installation to built-in NFS client, NFS common,
lockd, SUNRPC, and NFSD code. Link-order markers bracket each scope without
requiring policy registration or changes to syzkaller. Preserve the normal
KCSAN sampling behavior inside the allowed scope and expose admitted and
rejected candidate counters for validation.

